    },
    "regime_notes": "Negative in 2020-2023 (IC -0.02744), positive thereafter: 2024-2026 +0.06741, 2027-2029 +0.08254, 2030-2032 +0.18246, 2033-2034 +0.11445. Interpret conservatively given 15-asset cross-section; robust post-2024 regime evidence.",
